{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1310107001:0":{"text":"시더 마을이 그리 큰 곳은 아니지만, 겨울 제전은 늘 이곳에서 열리곤 했어요.","source_cn":"别看雪松镇不大，可冬日祭典一直在这儿举办。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FF96AB4F42EEFE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1310107002:0":{"text":"듣기로는 첫 번째 신마 대전 때, 전쟁 영웅을 기리기 위한 것이라더군요...","source_cn":"说是为了纪念第一次神魔大战时候的战争英雄……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA846E49873FA14C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310107003:0":{"text":"전쟁 영웅이요? 그게 누군데요?","source_cn":"战争英雄，是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90246176F1E6A8C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310107004:0":{"text":"글쎄요. 어쨌든 여장군이라고 하더라고요. 마을에 가보면 알 수 있겠죠?!","source_cn":"这我不清楚，反正纪念的是位女将军。哎，你到镇子里就知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA8EAA89806F0B5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人斯瓦夫":{"text":"상인 스와프","source":"商人斯瓦夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}